* [[Dessicated Hydra Claw]]

==Notes==
*In the Scar, Graf Wask Derg shares the same spawn point with [[Jewk Swem Pleg]], [[Rept Parn Freg]] and [[Sheg Zamn Mada]]. Each will follow the same patrol route.
*In Diviner's Ascent, Graf Wask Derg shares the same spawn point with [[Brol Migo Hinga]], [[Jewk Swem Pleg]], [[Chak Hack Schawack]], and [[Sheg Zamn Mada]]. Each will follow the same patrol route.

==Trivia==
*All Hydra bosses have one name for each head.
